1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,480
(Sheldon:)I gargled with tequila and may
have swallowed a teeny bit.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,640
- You all right?
- Fine.

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,150
(Sheldon:)Thank you for asking.

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:08,180
(Sheldon:)I love you so much.

5
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,280
(Sheldon:)Fire demon.

6
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,920
(Raj:)Ooh, fire demon.

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,750
(Raj:)Sheldon's turning up the heat...

8
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:21,850
(Howard:)Troll master.

9
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,290
(Raj:)Check it! Howard pulls one out

10
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,690
(Raj:)from under the bridge. Nice!

11
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:28,600
(Leonard:)Water nymph.

12
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,000
(Raj:)Oh, yeah, she's got puddles

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
(Raj:)in all the right places.

14
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,000
(Sheldon:)Could you please
play the game

15
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,530
(Sheldon:)without commenting
on every card?

16
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:37,770
(Sheldon:)Sorry.

17
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:40,100
(Raj:)Walking tree.

18
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:45,370
(Sheldon:)Last one.

19
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:48,110
(Raj:)I'm taking a stroll
and I'm sporting wood.

20
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:55,720
Okay, the Eagle has landed.

21
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:57,180
(Leonard:)What's going on?

